Stark modifications notice
=========================

Stark's Qwen3.8 encodable blocks and numerical reference controls adapt algorithms from lily-qwen3.8-flash-next revision e22d58fa7cc488493fb1b5d810a198bd29730aeb. The implementation uses Stark's standard Uzu parameter, matrix, backend, buffer, kernel, command and language-model infrastructure. Adapted algorithms have been changed and reorganized; this is not an unmodified upstream distribution. See docs/QWEN38_UZU_PROVENANCE.md for the integration scope. Upstream copyright and attribution notices are retained below and in affected sources.

